     <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Indicator definition: The average score of BIOFIN countries&apos; level of institutionalization of the BIOFIN process in their organizational frameworks. Level of institutionalization to be measured per rubric provided in Figure 7.2 in the BIOFIN Workbook 2018 (p. 167).
